WEBVTT

00:03:28.788 --> 00:03:31.371
jahaan main kisee bhe roopr
mein ashaj mahasoos hoon

00:03:31.371 --> 00:03:34.079
ek trans adhmi ya 
sokhee tvacha ke roop men

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:36.954
is maamale mein donon"

00:03:36.954 --> 00:03:38.663
Eemaanadaar rahana,

00:03:38.663 --> 00:03:41.454
mainne apanee tvacha kee
dinacharya ko nain badala

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:42.913
eemel bhejane ke baad se

00:03:42.913 --> 00:03:45.454
Lekin main apanee
tvacha mein adhik

00:03:45.454 --> 00:03:46.663
sahaj hoon

00:03:46.663 --> 00:03:49.204
in jaisee pratikriyaon ke kaaran

00:03:49.204 --> 00:03:51.871
[Aaphee ke paas sabhee
ka pyaar hain, Micah!

00:03:51.871 --> 00:03:54.163
Aur main atyadhik Clinique 
kee salaah deti hoon]

00:03:54.163 --> 00:03:56.038
Tum kamaal ke admi ho.
mere pasand ke ho

00:03:56.079 --> 00:03:57.704
vyakti honge (kaam par).

00:03:57.788 --> 00:03:59.496
aapakee sokhee
tvacha ke saath bhee]

00:03:59.496 --> 00:04:00.913
[Khud hone ke lie
dhanyavaad,